<title>USA: Boeing, MD to seek merger approval within 2 weeks.</title>
<headline>Boeing, MD to seek merger approval within 2 weeks.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boeing Co CEO Phil Condit said Sunday he expects to file the necessary papers with the U.S. government for a merger with McDonnell Douglas Corp within the next two weeks.</p>
<p>Condit told reporters the companies would consult with the Defense Department and would make filings with the Anti-trust Division of the Justice Department, as required under the Hart-Scott-Rodino Act.</p>
</text>
